2	// opened from the setup card's "All settings" link (the "JusPrin v2" canvas,
3	// page "Current Setup Card", the four "All settings" boards). The host reads
4	// the table (settings_catalog); this page only arranges it. Showing follows
5	// the selection in the 3D view: the whole project, one plate when the project
6	// has more than one, or one object, for which only what it sets itself is
7	// listed. The first version is read-only: the design's "Use project value"
